  <h1>About Mattally</h1>
  <p>Mattally builds straightforward material calculators for home and trade projects.</p>

  <h2>What we do</h2>
  <p>Our calculators turn measurements into the quantities suppliers actually sell: cubic yards, tons, bags, boxes, gallons and rolls.</p>
  <p>Each estimate shows the assumptions behind it, including density, coverage and waste allowance. We test the calculation code against worked examples, but real materials and job sites vary.</p>

  <h2>Editorial approach</h2>
  <p>We write for someone planning a real purchase, not for a search engine. Guidance is kept specific to the material and the job. When local codes, product instructions or supplier measurements take priority, we say so.</p>

